{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1539069-fae-touched-hunters-because-why-not","id":1539069,"title":"Fae-touched Hunters - because why not?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-07-22T17:28:23-07:00","id":1539069,"title":"Fae-touched Hunters - because why not?","content":"Project Nebula:<br /> You lost your sister when you were little. She just disappeared. It was actually while you were researching disappearances that you found out about the Visitors. Well, it's been a long, strange trip, but you stood at the Damned crossroads and you said the words, and then you were in. And that strange place seemed to know you, and it touched you, and you were changed. Funny thing, though - you've met others like you, and you don't have the dreams that they report. They say that maybe that means she's dead, or maybe that means she got away already, and in is living somewhere far way with a new name and maybe a new face. Or maybe she just got taken by some regular human sicko.<br /> (Your heart would break all over again if you ever knew for sure it was that <i>small</i>, that <i>common</i>.)<br /> <br /> Ashwood Abbey:<br /> One of those creepy little nerds who date back to the Weimar Republic (The Weimar Republic! What a party that was! Pity you weren't born yet...) once told you that in the old times sometimes wise men would let trolls &quot;use them as women&quot; - his words - to learn magic spells. He was horrified about it, but you felt that tingle and thought &quot;How can I get some of this action?&quot; (&quot;Used as a woman,&quot; ridiculous. For all he's read, he wasn't at that party when you gave that grubby little telepathic sub-witch $1,000 and a decent dinner to switch your sensoria around. He doesn't know <i>anything </i>about what it's like to be a woman - and be &quot;used&quot; - but you do, now. And it is <i>not</i> the same.) Well, you put out some feelers, and you found that faeries are rare, and gay people aren't <i>that </i>common, and that compounding improbability meant you just couldn't make contact with a faerie who wanted to do you up the ass. Then, out of the blue, you spotted this utterly beautiful faerie throwaway with &quot;don't touch me&quot; all over her a yard thick. You'll never know where the inspiration came from. &quot;Do you want sex?&quot; you asked, straight out - more honest than you've been in quite a while. She looked like she was going to cry. She looked like she'd make the Earth swallow you. She looked like she would weep inconsolably the whole time the stones ground your bones to powder, which was going to take <i>hours</i><i>.</i> &quot;I'll do anything you want,&quot; you said, &quot;And nothing you don't want.&quot; &quot;Why?&quot; &quot;Because I want you to teach me a magic spell.&quot;<br /> She went for it. She gets a charge out of taking the initiative. It might even really be helping her. It seems she was getting it regular and amazing from the thing that owned her, back in fairyland - along with a heaping helping of emotional abuse. You know that song too, but apparently not like she does. She tried to teach you a magic spell, but it never worked until the time you went back to her place - some strange little hovel on the other side of a magic door.<br /> You see her pretty often. One of these times, she may be be ready to try penetration.<br /> <br /> White Hare Society:<br /> Say hi. Share blood. That simple.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28549-sikander","name":"Sikander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}